{"asset_key":"mn/quest_story_10297500","episode":"mn","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10297500","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:3:1029750001:1":{"text":"来的路上，我已经听满满说过来龙去脉了。","source_cn":"来的路上，我已经听满满说过来龙去脉了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5B3F8ED2D4199B49","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1029750002:1":{"text":"我不太确定能否胜任，毕竟此前我一直在丛林间离群索居……","source_cn":"我不太确定能否胜任，毕竟此前我一直在丛林间离群索居……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x403879D733CE0C20","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1029750003:1":{"text":"不会呀，法拉莫尔，你是最合适的人选！","source_cn":"不会呀，法拉莫尔，你是最合适的人选！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF54EE494CA7E2625","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1029750004:1":{"text":"你又熟悉这里的道路，为人又风度翩翩——","source_cn":"你又熟悉这里的道路，为人又风度翩翩——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x549AA8669BB44107","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1029750005:1":{"text":"而且战斗力和领导力都非常强！","source_cn":"而且战斗力和领导力都非常强！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA6B5C6388FA8DC0E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1029750006:1"